#: of saealib.acquisition.lcb.gp_ucb_beta_schedule:1
msgid ""
"Return the finite-domain GP-UCB ``beta_t`` schedule for use with "
"``beta_schedule``."
msgstr "``beta_schedule``に渡す、有限領域向けGP-UCBの``beta_t``スケジュールを返します。"

#: of saealib.acquisition.lcb.gp_ucb_beta_schedule:3
msgid ""
"``beta_t = 2 log(domain_size * t^2 * pi^2 / (6 * delta))``, the schedule "
"the cited regret bound uses for a finite search domain of size "
"``domain_size`` :cite:`srinivas2012gpucb`. For a continuous domain, "
"``domain_size`` is a discretization-count proxy supplied by the caller; "
"this function does not derive one."
msgstr ""
"``beta_t = 2 log(domain_size * t^2 * pi^2 / (6 * delta))``は、引用文献 "
":cite:`srinivas2012gpucb` "
"の後悔上界がサイズ``domain_size``の有限探索領域に対して用いるスケジュールです。連続領域の場合、``domain_size``は呼び出し側が与える離散化点数の代理値であり、この関数自体はその値を導出しません。"

#: ../../api/acquisition.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "パラメータ"

#: of saealib.acquisition.lcb.gp_ucb_beta_schedule:9
msgid ""
"Size of the (possibly discretized) search domain (``|D|`` in the cited "
"bound). Must be positive."
msgstr "（離散化されている場合を含む）探索領域のサイズ（引用文献の``|D|``）。正の値でなければなりません。"

#: of saealib.acquisition.lcb.gp_ucb_beta_schedule:12
msgid "Confidence parameter. Must satisfy ``0 < delta < 1``. Default: 0.1."
msgstr "信頼度パラメータ。``0 < delta < 1``を満たさなければなりません。既定値は0.1。"

#: ../../api/acquisition.md
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返します"

#: of saealib.acquisition.lcb.gp_ucb_beta_schedule:15
msgid ""
"A picklable ``schedule(t) -> float``, increasing in the round index ``t``"
" (``t`` starting at 1; raises "
":class:`~saealib.exceptions.ValidationError` for ``t < 1``)."
msgstr ""
"pickle可能な``schedule(t) -> float``。反復回数``t``（1始まり）に対して増加します。``t < 1``の場合は"
" :class:`~saealib.exceptions.ValidationError` を送出します。"

#: ../../api/acquisition.md
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "戻り値の型"

#: ../../api/acquisition.md
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "発生する例外"

#: of saealib.acquisition.lcb.gp_ucb_beta_schedule:20
msgid "If ``domain_size`` is not positive, or ``delta`` is not in ``(0, 1)``."
msgstr "``domain_size``が正でない場合、または``delta``が``(0, 1)``の範囲外の場合。"

